  m_Name: Merchant Ledger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Merchant Ledger
  content: "Trade Ledger \u2014 Amberwood Exchange\nAmbercap exports continue to
    exceed expectations.\nCrystal shipments remain profitable despite repeated reports
    from surveyors regarding unstable trade routes.\nSeveral caravan masters have
    requested alternate paths through the forest.\nRequests denied.\nDelays are preferable
    to alarming investors."
